{"doc_id": "bericht_b5b65554", "page_number": 1, "span_id": "p1_s4", "bbox": [42.52000045776367, 286.9023132324219, 70.83399963378906, 300.1089172363281], "text": "hervor.", "font_size": 9.899999618530273, "bold": false, "italic": false, "line_height": 13.20660400390625, "x_center": 56.67700004577637, "y_bottom": 300.1089172363281, "column": 0, "reading_order": 7, "rotation": 0.0, "language": null, "is_whitespace": false, "char_count": 0, "word_count": 0}
{"doc_id": "bericht_b5b65554", "page_number": 1, "span_id": "p1_s5", "bbox": [42.52000045776367, 516.3193359375, 469.8041687011719, 529.5259399414062], "text": "Der Bericht zeigt, dass es zwar bestimmte Fortschritte gibt, der Ausbau der Konnektivit\u00e4tsinfrastruktur, wie", "font_size": 9.899999618530273, "bold": false, "italic": false, "line_height": 13.20660400390625, "x_center": 256.1620845794678, "y_bottom": 529.5259399414062, "column": 0, "reading_order": 8, "rotation": 0.0, "language": null, "is_whitespace": false, "char_count": 0, "word_count": 0}
{"doc_id": "bericht_b5b65554", "page_number": 1, "span_id": "p1_s6", "bbox": [42.52000045776367, 530.915283203125, 524.7591552734375, 544.1218872070312], "text": "Glasfaser und 5G-Standalone-Netzwerke, jedoch immer noch hinterherhinkt. Mehr Unternehmen \u00fcbernehmen K\u00fcnstliche", "font_size": 9.899999618530273, "bold": false, "italic": false, "line_height": 13.20660400390625, "x_center": 283.6395778656006, "y_bottom": 544.1218872070312, "column": 0, "reading_order": 9, "rotation": 0.0, "language": null, "is_whitespace": false, "char_count": 0, "word_count": 0}
{"doc_id": "bericht_b5b65554", "page_number": 1, "span_id": "p1_s7", "bbox": [42.52000045776367, 545.5123291015625, 542.0841674804688, 558.7189331054688], "text": "Intelligenz (KI), Cloud und Big Data, aber die \u00dcbernahme muss beschleunigt werden. Etwas mehr als die H\u00e4lfte der Europ\u00e4er", "font_size": 9.899999618530273, "bold": false, "italic": false, "line_height": 13.20660400390625, "x_center": 292.3020839691162, "y_bottom": 558.7189331054688, "column": 0, "reading_order": 10, "rotation": 0.0, "language": null, "is_whitespace": false, "char_count": 0, "word_count": 0}
{"doc_id": "bericht_b5b65554", "page_number": 1, "span_id": "p1_s8", "bbox": [42.52000045776367, 560.109375, 549.7962036132812, 573.3159790039062], "text": "(55,6 %) verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber grundlegende digitale F\u00e4higkeiten, w\u00e4hrend die Verf\u00fcgbarkeit von ICT-Spezialisten mit fortgeschrittenen", "font_size": 9.899999618530273, "bold": false, "italic": false, "line_height": 13.20660400390625, "x_center": 296.15810203552246, "y_bottom": 573.3159790039062, "column": 0, "reading_order": 11, "rotation": 0.0, "language": null, "is_whitespace": false, "char_count": 0, "word_count": 0}
{"doc_id": "bericht_b5b65554", "page_number": 1, "span_id": "p1_s9", "bbox": [42.52000045776367, 574.705322265625, 514.8985595703125, 587.9119262695312], "text": "F\u00e4higkeiten niedrig bleibt und eine deutliche Geschlechterkluft aufweist, was den Fortschritt in Schl\u00fcsselbereichen wie", "font_size": 9.899999618530273, "bold": false, "italic": false, "line_height": 13.20660400390625, "x_center": 278.7092800140381, "y_bottom": 587.9119262695312, "column": 0, "reading_order": 12, "rotation": 0.0, "language": null, "is_whitespace": false, "char_count": 0, "word_count": 0}
